  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/BandaUnioMusicalPreparaCertamenAutonomic.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 244px;\" /></p>\n<p>(12 fotos) La banda simf&ograve;nica de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia d&#39;Onda participa diumenge 19 de novembre, a paritr de les 19 hores a Val&egrave;ncia en el XXXIX Certamen auton&ograve;mic i aquest dissabte ha celebrat al seu auditori el concert preparatori.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8504.jpg\" alt=\"img_8504\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8506.jpg\" alt=\"img_8506\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8507.jpg\" alt=\"img_8507\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8512.jpg\" alt=\"img_8512\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8513.jpg\" alt=\"img_8513\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8517.jpg\" alt=\"img_8517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8518.jpg\" alt=\"img_8518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8523.jpg\" alt=\"img_8523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/umscodissabte11novembre/img_8526.jpg\" alt=\"img_8526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><